      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T19:40:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This class replaces the need for this code in [125509](https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/125509/4/pce/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/transportpce/pce/graph/PostAlgoPathValidator.java#1105) (PostAlgoPathValidator):\n\n```\nBitSet occupied \u003d BitSet.valueOf(freqMap);\n...\nif (result.isEmpty()) {\n  return occupied;\n}\n```\n\nThis part can also be deleted from PostAlgoPathValidator:\n\n```\nprivate SpectrumAssignment createEmptySpectrumAssignment() {\n  return new SpectrumAssignmentBuilder()\n          .setBeginIndex(Uint16.valueOf(0))\n          .setStopIndex(Uint16.valueOf(0))\n          .setFlexGrid(true)\n          .build();\n}\n```\n\nEmptyAssignableSpectrum is returned whenever path validation finds no usable spectrum. Its `availableBitSet()` is empty and its `computeBestSpectrumAssignment()` returns begin and stop index 0, so the caller treats it like any other result.",
